# Android build and install

After changing Android app code or Gradle config (`app/src/**`, `app/build.gradle.kts`, root `build.gradle.kts`, `settings.gradle.kts`), run from the project root:

```bash
./gradlew installDebug
```

Do this before you finish the turn when those files were modified. A project `stop` hook also runs `installDebug` after agent edits; still run it yourself if hooks are disabled or the install failed.

Requires a device or emulator connected (`adb devices`).
